# Project Overview

**Monorepo:** pnpm workspaces + Turbo. Root `package.json` has `pnpm codegen` for Dato GraphQL codegen.

**Rules index:** `.cursor/rules/README.md` lists rule files; **`AGENTS.md`** (repo root) is the short agent guide.

## Package layout

| Package | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `apps/website` | Astro app (SSR via Vercel). Layout, `*-container` components, logic binding only. Core UI imported from `packages/ui`. Follows `website-behaviour.mdc`. |
| `packages/design-system` | Tailwind v4, CSS variables, typography, colors, grid, spacing. Import via `@rotate/design-system/design-system.css`. |
| `packages/ui` | All core UI components (Header, Footer, Button, NavLink, etc.). Grouped by domain. No app logic, no CMS. Website imports from here. |
| `packages/utilities` | Shared, framework-agnostic helpers. UI-related helpers live under `src/ui/` (re-exported from `src/ui/index.ts`). Import **`@rotate/utilities/ui`**. Other paths use `@rotate/utilities/…` as needed. |
| `packages/service-dato` | CMS layer. All Dato logic. App imports via `@rotate/cms` alias only. |
| `packages/devtools` | Dev-only components (GridViewer, BreakpointsViewer). Used in layouts. |
| `packages/build-*` | Shared configs (eslint, prettier, tsconfig). |

