## Key conventions

- **File names:** Lowercase, kebab-case (e.g. `my-component.astro`, `base-layout.astro`).
- **Website data binding:** Use **`*-container`** folders under `apps/website/src/components/` (see `website-architecture.mdc`). All Dato access via `@rotate/cms` only; CMS implementation lives in `packages/service-dato` (`service-dato.mdc`).
- **Design system:** Tailwind v4 with `@theme` and `@utility`. Uses `@source` to scan `apps/website` and `devtools` for class usage.

## Website path aliases (`apps/website`)

Defined in `apps/website/tsconfig.json` (`paths`) and `apps/website/astro.config.mjs` (Vite `resolve.alias`). Keep both in sync.

| Alias | Resolves to |
|-------|-------------|
| `@/*` | `apps/website/src/*` (e.g. `@/lib/…` for shared site helpers) |
| `@rotate/cms` | `packages/service-dato/src/index.ts` (public API only; all Dato code lives in that package) |
| `@rotate/design-system/*` | `packages/design-system/src/*` |
| `@rotate/devtools/*` | `packages/devtools/src/*` |
| `@rotate/ui/*` | `packages/ui/src/*` |
| `@rotate/utilities/*` | `packages/utilities/src/*` |

- **Layout:** `base-layout.astro` in website — binds composition, imports design-system and devtools. Layout stays in website; core UI in `packages/ui`.

## packages/ui vs apps/website

| Layer | Location | Responsibility |
|-------|----------|----------------|
| Core UI | `packages/ui` | Buttons, inputs, NavLink, cards, etc. Grouped by domain. No app logic, no CMS. Optional minimal JS per `website-behaviour.mdc`. |
| Layout, containers, binding | `apps/website` | Layout binds composition; **`*-container`** folders fetch and pass props to `packages/ui` (and optional wrappers). Follows `website-architecture.mdc` and `website-behaviour.mdc`. |

